From 58656a73ab111d32339c947692a712ed362574bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:12:21 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] Attendance & leave management: redesign, fixes, leave
 workflow, configurable allowance

- Attendance: new employee and team pages (summary cards, calendar, trends, history
  with filters, today board, CSV export), admin corrections with audit notes
- Fixes: duplicate punch race (lock + unique index), invalid punch-outs, overnight
  shifts, null holidays crash, early-out overwriting late, print_r in the monthly API,
  IDOR on attendance notes, unauthenticated settings update and attendance filter,
  dashboard side effects (auto-closing open shifts, absences for system user/weekends)
- Settings: working days, early punch-in window, holiday picker
- Leave: types, per-year balances (allowance snapshot, carry-forward, adjustments),
  apply/preview/cancel, approve/reject/revoke with audit trail and notifications
- Configurable annual allowance (default 12), leave year start month
- Admin dashboard: monthly performance with filters and pending leave count
- Scheduled attendance:close-days; attendance:add-unique-index helper
- Feature tests (37)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017GCsXMaUQHHwG6TR9wD6mw
